title: Influence of background treatment with mineralocorticoid receptor antagonists on ivabradine's effects in patients with chronic heart failure.
pubtypes: ['Comparative Study', 'Journal Article', 'Multicenter Study', 'Randomized Controlled Trial']
screen_rule: INCLUDE
screen_span: population “…n patients with chronic heart failure.”; comparator “…ugs. Event rates in the placebo group were higher in pa…”
