title: Baseline characteristics of patients in the treatment of preserved cardiac function heart failure with an aldosterone antagonist trial.
pubtypes: ['Journal Article', 'Multicenter Study', 'Randomized Controlled Trial', 'Research Support, N.I.H., Extramural']
screen_rule: INCLUDE
